docs {
  # AdelieStack API

  A generic request collection for the AdelieStack API.

  ## Environments

  - **local** — Local development. `baseUrl` points at the SvelteKit dev
    server (`http://localhost:5173`), which proxies `/api/*` to the Hono API.
    Set `baseUrl` to `http://localhost:3001` to hit the API directly.

  ## Authentication

  Session-authenticated endpoints read the `Cookie` header. Set the
  `sessionCookie` environment variable and the collection-level pre-request
  script attaches it automatically.
}

script:pre-request {
  const sessionCookie = bru.getEnvVar("sessionCookie");
  if (sessionCookie) {
    req.setHeader("Cookie", sessionCookie);
  }
}
